&lt;div class="ltag-github-body"&gt;

&lt;div id="readme" class="md"&gt;&lt;div class="markdown-heading"&gt;
&lt;h1 class="heading-element"&gt;Tolerix&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision before production.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tolerix is an AI-assisted manufacturing preflight web application designed for small laser-cutting businesses, acrylic and signage shops, custom-product makers, and fabrication workshops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It bridges the gap between what a customer requests and the actual vector drawing file prepared for manufacturing, calculating geometric discrepancies deterministically and generating an evidence-backed pre-production audit report.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown-heading"&gt;
&lt;h2 class="heading-element"&gt;Screenshots&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown-heading"&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element"&gt;Landing Page&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/greenbugx/Tolerix/docs/landing-page.png"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fgreenbugx%2FTolerix%2FHEAD%2Fdocs%2Flanding-page.png" alt="Tolerix Landing Page"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown-heading"&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element"&gt;Production Dashboard&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/greenbugx/Tolerix/docs/dashboard.png"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fgreenbugx%2FTolerix%2FHEAD%2Fdocs%2Fdashboard.png" alt="Tolerix Production Dashboard"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
