&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 &lt;a href="https://go.posthog.com/twir-oct14" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;PostHog - 10,000 PRs a month is easy: How devex is evolving at PostHog&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👀 &lt;a href="https://github.com/necolas/react-native-web/discussions/2872" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Expo to maintain React Native Web, moving to React Foundation&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👀 &lt;a href="https://github.com/react/react-native/pull/58664" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;RNTester moves to native UITabBarController for iPhone Duo support&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📜 &lt;a href="https://expo.dev/blog/your-skills-need-an-evaluation-mechanism" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Your skills need an evaluation mechanism&lt;/a&gt; - Direct invocation doesn't prove discovery. Evals must test normal prompts and traces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📜 &lt;a href="https://www.dainemawer.com/shared-typescript-nextjs-expo-monorepo" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Sharing a TypeScript Domain Layer Between Next.js and Expo&lt;/a&gt; - Share types, validation schemas and thin API client. Keep navigation, UI, storage and session handling app-local.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📜 &lt;a href="https://shift.infinite.red/you-dont-need-a-rewrite-expo-s-new-brownfield-react-native-story-c072b4e971dd" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;You Don’t Need a Rewrite: Expo’s New Brownfield React Native Story&lt;/a&gt; - Brownfield has historically been hard, but things changed with Expo SDK 54. Covers myths vs. realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 &lt;a href="https://maestro.dev/blog/maestro-mcp-for-ai-coding-agents?utm_source=this-week-in-react" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Maestro MCP - Open-source MCP server for mobile UI testing with AI agents&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/wcandillon/react-native-skia/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Skia 3.1 → 3.4 - New snapshot API, shared WebGPU instance via Dawn, tvOS and Mac Catalyst support&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/callstack/react-native-testing-library/releases/tag/v14.1.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;RNTL 14.1 - &lt;code&gt;fireEvent.layout&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;userEvent.pullToRefresh&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;userEvent.accessibilityAction&lt;/code&gt;, RN 0.88 support&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://tamagui.dev/blog/version-three" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Tamagui 3 - New C++ native runtime, Rust compiler, Strict DOM, flat style props, Tailwind syntax&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://onestack.dev" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;One 2.0 - All-in-one RN framework, Bun for cross-platform, Rust bundler, SwiftUI and Compose generated&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/gmi-software/react-native-better-pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Better PDF 1.0 - PDFKit and PdfRenderer, Native viewer on Nitro Views, no WebView or JS in scroll path&lt;/a&gt; - 91ms for 1,000 pages, 8x faster than react-native-pdf on large docs per author benchmark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/chrispader/expo-native-variants" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Expo Native Variants - Generate Xcode schemes and Android flavors using an Expo config plugin in one prebuild&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/mahdidavoodi7/react-native-wifi-aware" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;WiFi Aware - Peer-to-peer discovery and high-bandwidth data over Wi-Fi Aware&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/gronxb/hot-updater/releases/tag/v1.0.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Hot Updater 1.0 - Shared release catalog, insights, remote config, plugins&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-react-native/releases/tag/8.30.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Sentry 8.30 - Cellular generation in connection type, Hermes Expo trace fixes&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://swmansion.com/changelog/react-native-nano-icons-1-0-0/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Nano Icons 1.0 - Hot reload Metro plugin, native tab bar symbols, animatable size and color&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://swmansion.com/changelog/react-native-screens-4-29-0/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Screens 4.29 - iOS Tabs move to UITab API, search tab, sidebar placement, custom icons&lt;/a&gt; - Pairs well with Nano Icons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/software-mansion/argent/releases/tag/v0.28.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Argent 0.28 - iOS launch arguments, flows over a link, failed-step screenshots&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://expo.dev/changelog/native-crash-reporting-in-eas-observe" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Expo Observe - Native crash reporting on Android and iOS, no setup, AI handoff&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/callstackincubator/rozenite/releases/tag/v2.5.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Rozenite 2.5 - Lynx project detection, XHR-first network capture, Redux action filters, agent grammar v3&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/nandorojo/galeria/releases/tag/v3.1.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Galeria 3.1 - Photo and video galleries on iOS, Android and web&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎥 &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dj6fhEwXZ6I" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Callstack - Ten Agents Waiting for Input: Tzvetan Mikov on AI Coding and Hermes&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎙️ &lt;a href="https://infinite.red/react-native-radio/rnr-375-rnr-explains-ota-updates" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;RNR 375 - RNR Explains: EAS Update&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
