&lt;h2&gt;


🔀 Other
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👀 &lt;a href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/13063" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;HTML PR - AsyncContext integration&lt;/a&gt; - Still TC39 stage 2, this exciting feature is actively worked on, in particular its integration with web platform APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📣 &lt;a href="https://deno.com/blog/cloudflare" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Deno is joining Cloudflare&lt;/a&gt; - The Deno team is joining to work on the Workers and toward making the Durable Objects programming model self-hostable. The Deno runtime and Deno Deploy will be sunset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📜 &lt;a href="https://lea.verou.me/blog/2026/icons/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;The best way to use icons in Web UIs&lt;/a&gt; - Using icons as CSS design tokens, inserted and tweaked with pseudo-elements, masks, and style queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📜 &lt;a href="https://alfy.blog/2026/10/09/iframe-that-finally-fit-their-content.html" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Iframes that finally fit their content&lt;/a&gt; - Chrome 154 ships &lt;code&gt;frame-sizing: content-height&lt;/code&gt;. Iframes can now adjust their size without the &lt;code&gt;postMessage&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;ResizeObserver&lt;/code&gt; dance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📜 JPEG XL finally lands in &lt;a href="https://tonisagrista.com/blog/2026/chrome-jpegxl/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Chrome 155&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Firefox/Releases/158" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Firefox 158&lt;/a&gt;. Safari already has partial support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://bun.com/blog/bun-v1.4.3" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Bun 1.4.3 - &lt;code&gt;bun check&lt;/code&gt; type checker, 67% lower idle CPU in servers, &lt;code&gt;Bun.FetchSession&lt;/code&gt;, faster &lt;code&gt;JSON.parse&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Includes a port of typescript-go running 3-6x faster. No emit, no LSP. Coming next: 𝕏 &lt;a href="https://x.com/jiahan_c/status/2109561168822251634" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;bun lint&lt;/code&gt; with 1,000+ built-in rules&lt;/a&gt; and 𝕏 &lt;a href="https://x.com/bunjavascript/status/2109861465100632567" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;bun fmt&lt;/code&gt;, a 320x faster Prettier alternative&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;tsc-rs - Rust port of the TypeScript 7 compiler, type checker, and LSP&lt;/a&gt; - Theo’s agent-driven port of TS, with the Effect language service diagnostics built in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/releases/tag/v1.64.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Playwright 1.64 - WebMCP testing APIs, better videos (custom fps, CSS-styled actions, VP9), &lt;code&gt;--shuffle&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;locator.within()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://pnpm.io/blog?type=releases" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;pnpm 12.11 → 12.13 - Agent skills linking, remote cache for task results and builds&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/QwikDev/partytown/releases/tag/v1.0.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Partytown 1.0 - Run third-party scripts in a web worker, now stable&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://webkit.org/blog/18420/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-254/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Safari Technology Preview 254 - &lt;code&gt;calc-size()&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;interpolate-size&lt;/code&gt;, CSS linked parameters, and more&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




